                <mxCell id="l5-d" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;API services on the on-demand node group&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;catalog, upload and playback run as FastAPI pods in private subnets, each with its own IRSA role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="l5" vertex="1">
